        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#221F2C] dark:text-[#F5F3FA] mb-3">2. What the App is</h2>
          <p class="mb-3">
            Odys Travel is a private travel journal. It estimates countries, regions, cities, stays, distances, and routes from photo dates, photo locations, bundled geographic data, and what you enter yourself. Those figures can be incomplete or wrong.
          </p>
          <p>
            The App is not a record of residence, visas, taxes, borders, or presence. It is not medical, emergency, or navigation software. Do not rely on it for a legal, safety, or official purpose.
