          <p class="mb-3">
            Country borders and first-level regions are adapted from Natural Earth, which is in the public domain. Geometry is simplified for on-device use.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-3">
            City names and coordinates come from GeoNames and are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0. The bundled set is limited to cities above 15,000 population. Attribution is also shown in the App under Settings → Data sources &amp; licenses.
