          <p>
            The App does not currently offer in-app purchases or subscriptions. If a purchase is added later, its price and what it unlocks will be shown in the App before you pay, payment will be charged by Apple to your Apple ID, and refunds will be handled by Apple. Developer does not see or store your card number and cannot issue an App Store refund directly.
          </p>
        </section>

