            Developer may update these Terms. The effective date shows the current version. If a change is material, it will be posted on this page before or when it takes effect. If you do not agree, stop using the App and delete it. If you keep using the App after the effective date, the updated Terms apply. Mandatory consumer rights are unaffected.
